1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:12,835
Accounts screen par dukaan ka roz ka hisaab hai.

2
00:00:12,875 --> 00:00:19,878
Sabse pehle expense entry: kiraaya, tankhwaah,
bijli, internet, transport, marammat,

3
00:00:19,918 --> 00:00:22,142
stationery ya bank charges.

4
00:00:22,915 --> 00:00:27,435
Category Repairs, amount aath sau pachaas,
bhugtaan cash se,

5
00:00:27,475 --> 00:00:30,170
aur note mein likhiye kya theek hua.

6
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:32,678
'Add expense for today' dabaaiye.

7
00:00:33,425 --> 00:00:38,817
Cash book mein aaj ka har len-den hai: bikri ka
cash, customers se vasooli,

8
00:00:38,857 --> 00:00:42,801
supplier payments aur kharch, ant mein In, Out
aur Net.

9
00:00:43,555 --> 00:00:46,742
Bank ka hisaab 'UPI & Bank' screen par hai.

10
00:00:46,782 --> 00:00:53,271
Bank statement Excel ya CSV mein upload kijiye;
Medoro har UPI aur bank credit ko bills

11
00:00:53,311 --> 00:00:58,599
aur payments se milaata hai, aur jo nahi mile,
unhein alag dikhata hai.

12
00:00:59,364 --> 00:01:05,155
Munaafa 'Reports & GST' screen par 'Sales and
profit' mein hai: taareekh-vaar bikri,

13
00:01:05,195 --> 00:01:06,891
returns aur gross profit.

14
00:01:06,931 --> 00:01:10,778
Ise CSV mein nikaalkar apne accountant ko de
sakte hain.

15
00:01:11,558 --> 00:01:17,418
Dhyan dein: Google Drive wale counter par abhi
day book, poora ledger, trial balance,

16
00:01:17,458 --> 00:01:21,999
profit and loss statement aur cash flow ki alag
reports nahi hain.

17
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:27,622
Bank connection apne-aap sync ke liye bank ya
Account Aggregator partner chahiye,

18
00:01:27,662 --> 00:01:29,704
jo is demo mein juda nahi hai.

19
00:01:35,746 --> 00:01:39,809
Medicine ki MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota
hai.

20
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:44,154
Medoro har bill par MRP se taxable value
nikaalta hai,

21
00:01:44,194 --> 00:01:51,154
aur Jharkhand ke andar ki bikri par GST ko CGST
aur SGST mein aadha-aadha baant'ta hai.

22
00:01:51,194 --> 00:01:55,418
Doosre rajya ke GST wale customer par IGST lagta
hai.

23
00:01:56,169 --> 00:02:01,362
Har medicine ka HSN code aur GST rate uske
master mein rehta hai,

24
00:02:01,402 --> 00:02:03,697
jaise medicines ke liye 3004.

25
00:02:03,737 --> 00:02:08,366
'Reports & GST' screen par GST returns wala
hissa dekhiye.

26
00:02:09,119 --> 00:02:10,798
GST month chuniye.

27
00:02:10,838 --> 00:02:17,771
Medoro us mahine ke bills se GSTR-1 banata hai:
B2B, B2C aur HSN summary,

28
00:02:17,811 --> 00:02:21,973
section-wise taxable value aur tax ke saath.

29
00:02:22,742 --> 00:02:30,106
Yahan se GSTR-1 JSON, jo GST portal ke offline
tool mein jaata hai, HSN summary CSV,

30
00:02:30,146 --> 00:02:34,248
aur GSTR-3B ke JSON aur CSV download hote hain.

31
00:02:35,009 --> 00:02:39,372
Bahut zaroori: yeh reports filing mein madad ke
liye hain.

32
00:02:39,412 --> 00:02:45,901
GST return file karne se pehle inhein apne
accountant ya CA se zaroor check karvaaiye.

33
00:02:45,941 --> 00:02:49,621
Tally export is counter par uplabdh nahi hai;
CSV

34
00:02:49,661 --> 00:02:52,961
aur JSON exports aapke CA ke kaam aate hain.
